id: everyday-browsing
section: The engine
item: Everyday browsing on the engine: a real site loads and scrolls, a search box takes the keyboard, back comes back — nothing slower or odder than before
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://duckduckgo.com/
kit: cavekit-engine-update.md R8
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:textarea[name="q"]' 60
calibrate 'sel:textarea[name="q"]'
expect keyboard up 8
tap-at 384 300
launch https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad 60
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
drag 480 900 480 300
expect card-scroll-min 300
chrome back
wait url duckduckgo 40
